<title>UK: BOE revises shortage forecast to one bln stg.</title>
<headline>BOE revises shortage forecast to one bln stg.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England revised its forecast for the liquidity shortage to one billion stg from 1.1 billion and an invited another round of fixed rate operations.</p>
<p>The residual shortage is 305 million stg.</p>
</text>
